OL,3,GNEWSAStudent was raped, filmed and
OL,4,Adumped in rural road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student was raped, filmed and dumped
OL,7,Fin a rural road by three men who picked
OL,8,Fher up in Birmingham in a car they had
OL,9,Fhired for the sole purpose of attacking
OL,10,Fsomeone.
OL,12,FArjan Purewal, Jaskaran Thandi and
OL,13,FHassan Jangheer drove their victim up
OL,14,Fand down Broad Street in Birmingham in
OL,15,FSeptember 2023 before heading to the
OL,16,FClent Hills in Worcestershire.
OL,18,FThe victim was filmed by Purewal as she
OL,19,Fwas subjected to a serious sexual
OL,20,Fassault before being dumped in Vine
OL,21,FLane in Clent at about 03:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
